freedom  success is doing what you want when you  want where you want with whom you want  as much as you want  last night i met up with an entrepreneur  friend of mine for the past 10 years  he's been doing the same business and  he's tired of it  he's had success but he needs change he  needs something new his passion just  isn't there anymore  but he has a wife and kids now  responsibilities the next business idea  needs to make money and quickly or he's  going to be out looking for a job  panic sets in  there's so much fear in making a change  that he keeps doing what he's doing  instead of trying something else  it's the smart thing to do  winning ideas  here's what i know about finding winning  ideas  you don't get them be being stressed out  and trying to force them  that's the recipe for failure  it's like going on a first date with  someone and thinking about whether  you're going to marry them or not  chill out  give yourself freedom  your best ideas will come when you give  yourself the freedom to explore  i told my friend not to quit his  business but don't close down other  options either  explore try new things see if you like  them  don't put all this pressure on yourself  to find the next idea and if it doesn't  immediately work out you're quitting it  when your mind is free to think  amazing things will happen  here's a salsa tale  after breaking up with my girlfriend of  five years i decided to pick up salsa  dancing  i loved learning to dance and she hated  it what a perfect time to explore and be  free  i fell in love with it the music the  people the movement everything  little did i know that years later i  would go on to be a salsa instructor dj  events three times a week i'm being an  investor one of north america's largest  salsa dance companies  here's the thing  salsa has given me a great business  opportunity but that's not what i got in  it for  i was just exploring an interest and it  became so much more  i could have just gone to one class and  hated it i moved on to something else  i loved it and it became a natural  extension of what i do  expectations  i went in with complete freedom and no  expectations if i was desperate for a  new business opportunity and it had to  work out immediately  i would never have fallen in love with  salsa  i had no background in it took huge  steps couldn't understand the music i  was learning way too late in life didn't  have time to commit full time and so on  all the odds were against me from a  business point of view  but it became a great business because i  fell in love with it and gave myself the  freedom to explore it  freedom  if you're looking for your next winning  idea the idea that will put you on the  map the one that will give you all the  success money and contribution you're  looking for  stop pressuring yourself  give yourself the freedom to try new  things without the pressure of it being  the next big thing for you  you can't  plan to fall in love with someone you  can't plan to generate a great idea  but you can set yourself up with the  best conditions possible  and it starts with freedom  believe

